COMPILATION OF: E46N15

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N15

   1 a 0000 E46N15:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] RUNTIME ROUTING.  Console text on either
   4 a 0006      side of a FILE SKIP.  A misrouted skip shows up as an
   5 a 0006      extra line break in the CONSOLE transcript and a
   6 a 0006      missing one in the FILE -- a judgement on output, not
   7 a 0006      on .REL bytes, and it cannot be satisfied by making
   8 a 0006      CREATE byte-exact alone. */
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file;
  10 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N15OUT DAT');
  11 c 0023   put list('CON');
  12 c 003A   put file(outf) list('A');
  13 c 0054   put file(outf) skip;
  14 c 0068   put file(outf) list('B');
  15 c 0082   put list('AGAIN');
  16 c 0099   close file(outf);
  17 c 009F   stop;
  18 a 00A2 end E46N15;

CODE SIZE = 00A2
DATA AREA = 0014
FREE SYMS = 384C
END  COMPILATION
